#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.explode.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.explode"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.explode.explode:1 of
msgid "Explode list column(s) into multiple rows."
msgstr "将列表列展开为多行。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.explode.explode:3 of
msgid ""
"LiteFrame analogue of ``pandas.DataFrame.explode``: each list-like value "
"in ``column`` is expanded to one row per element; the other columns are "
"broadcast (repeated) across the expanded rows and keep their original "
"order.  An empty list or missing value produces a single NA row."
msgstr ""
"``pandas.DataFrame.explode`` 的 LiteFrame 对应方法：``column`` 中的每个类"
"列表值都会扩展为每个元素一行；其他列在扩展的行中进行广播（重复）并保持其"
"原始顺序。空列表或缺失值会产生一个单独的 NA 行。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.explode.explode:8 of
msgid ""
"When multiple columns are given they are exploded in lock-step (one "
"output row per element index across all of them), matching pandas; their "
"element counts must agree per row.  The expansion is a single "
"``flat_apply``."
msgstr ""
"当给定多个列时，它们会同步展开（所有列中每个元素索引对应一行），与 pandas"
" 一致；它们的元素数量必须每行匹配。扩展是单个 ``flat_apply``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.explode.explode of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.explode.explode:12 of
msgid "The list column(s) to explode."
msgstr "要展开的列表列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.explode.explode of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.explode.explode:15 of
msgid ""
"A new LiteFrame with the same columns; each exploded column now holds its"
" element dtype (the list's ``value_type``)."
msgstr ""
"具有相同列的新 LiteFrame；每个展开的列现在包含其元素的数据类型（列表的 ``"
"value_type``）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.explode.explode of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.explode.explode:21 of
msgid ":py:obj:`flat_apply`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.explode.explode:22 of
msgid "Apply a function per row, expanding to 0-N rows."
msgstr "按行应用函数，扩展为 0-N 行。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.explode.explode:24 of
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.list.flatten`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.explode.explode:25 of
msgid "Flatten a list column."
msgstr "展平列表列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.explode.explode:28 of
msgid "示例"
